  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[webdriverio](https://www.npmjs.com/package/webdriverio) just published its new version 4.3.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :warning:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      webdriverio\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      4.3.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build kept failing**.\n\n**It looks like your project, in its current form, is malfunctioning** and this update didn’t really change that. I don’t want to leave you in the dark about updates though. I recommend you get your project passing and then check the impact of this update again.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 93 commits .\n\n- [`57d68f5`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/57d68f5ed551071f9b77136b49e094710b508ada) <code>v4.3.0</code>\n- [`81dda1c`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/81dda1c7552653df71c1851d612f138d16e7420e) <code>Update contributors</code>\n- [`9317643`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/9317643e35d4d01c9e6b16e5779addbc16aaf19c) <code>updated changelog</code>\n- [`4004c62`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/4004c6232cb5284d4aab38503dd66614b6a8452c) <code>polished up guide section</code>\n- [`9c2059c`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/9c2059cc21fd2e1ceee066a730b3d457f06418f2) <code>bumped wdio-mocha-framework [ci skip]</code>\n- [`94a902a`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/94a902a59d9dbb43befe81571cf57aa4fdf66e21) <code>minor [ci skip]</code>\n- [`e7bb04f`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/e7bb04f21b7c4bb30b5dd7048f108afff1dd40cd) <code>don't build the project twice</code>\n- [`e72015e`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/e72015edec2cf5816ab8290a21bef48765363c59) <code>more build fixes</code>\n- [`f6f300e`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f6f300e308a42732aa3bae7b1ac306057c96a477) <code>fix some build issues</code>\n- [`b7c0754`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/b7c0754ba67ef01b9ea00cc83980c65ed7b2e98c) <code>remove grunt-cordova-cli as well</code>\n- [`2c317ba`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/2c317baa90a6e6549bbd69a9a8613d5bf2de6ffa) <code>remove cordova dev dependency as it installs vulnarable deps</code>\n- [`e4b5640`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/e4b5640af43ac0dfd65affccbe3da86754a78008) <code>add native test for touchActions</code>\n- [`5471794`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/5471794b8b5b9f35f835d0d3466cd4cd8b90643c) <code>eslint fixes</code>\n- [`7091be6`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/7091be620ba94a2c6b04df197e9e896e8e1efbf9) <code>no need for phantomjs prebuild as it is already available on travis</code>\n- [`a44eae6`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/a44eae6e7019086b030e20785f8a92e8b4a833bd) <code>don't propagate selector if x and y is given</code>\n\n\nThere are 93 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/d14d392773d42d000ac0255a41d30ddf6dd0fd59...57d68f5ed551071f9b77136b49e094710b508ada).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
